### 1. add cab
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cabs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "XYZ-1000",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Prius",
  "color": "Red",
  "cabType": "SEDAN",
  "driverId": 2
}

###

### 2. update cab
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cabs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Corolla",
  "color": "Red",
  "cabType": "SUV"
}

###

### 3. update status ONLINE
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cabs/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ONLINE"
}

###

### 4. get cabs by driver
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cabs/driver/2

###

### 5. get cabs by status
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cabs/status/ONLINE